{"step_index":588,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T01:08:59Z","thinking":"The decompiler appears to have successfully linked numerous script files to their corresponding mission references. For example, `0x0073741BBF863C76.ysc.cs` maps to `BAN_CARTE`, associated with the Chapter 3 Cartel Setup. Similarly, `0x01DEF83E0F656A0F.ysc.cs` corresponds to `CLB_VIDEO`, linked to the Chapter 3 Club Video.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python -c \"\nimport os\n\nbase = r'C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\work'\nwith open(os.path.join(base, 'decomp_refs_report.py'), 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    print(f.read()[:2000])\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Reading decomp_refs_report.py","toolSummary":"Inspect decomp_refs_report.py"}}]}
{"step_index":589,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T01:09:06Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T20:09:06-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T20:09:06-05:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n\"\"\"Print per-function mission reference summaries for one script from the decomp_mission_refs index.\"\"\"\r\n\r\nimport argparse\r\nimport json\r\nimport sys\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main() -> int:\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"index_json\", type=Path)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"script_name\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--names\", type=int, default=14)\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n\r\n    index = json.loads(args.index_json.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\r\n    functions = index.get(args.script_name)\r\n    if functions is None:\r\n        print(f\"No references recorded for {args.script_name}\", file=sys.stderr)\r\n        return 1\r\n\r\n    for function, entries in sorted(functions.items(), key=lambda item: item[1][0][0]):\r\n        ordered = []\r\n        for _, name in entries:\r\n            if name not in ordered:\r\n                ordered.append(name)\r\n\r\n        shown = \", \".join(ordered[:args.names])\r\n        suffix = \" ...\" if len(ordered) > args.names else \"\"\r\n        print(f\"{function} lines {entries[0][0]}..{entries[-1][0]} hits={len(entries)} missions={len(ordered)}: \"\r\n              f\"{shown}{suffix}\")\r\n\r\n    return 0\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    sys.exit(main())\r\n\r\n\n"}
